  "display_fullname": "Corruptor Buff Time Manipulation Temporal Mending",
  "display_help": "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured. Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds. Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs. Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.<br><br><color #fcfc95>Recharge: Slow.</color>",
